      "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site and <MATH_0002> a presheaf on <MATH_0003>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The rule\n<MATHSEG_0001> covering of <MATHSEG_0002>\nis a presheaf. And the colimit is a directed one.\n<STRUCT_0003> There is a canonical map of presheaves <MATH_0004>.\n<STRUCT_0004> If <MATH_0005> is a separated presheaf then <MATH_0006> is a sheaf\nand the map in (2) is injective.\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0007> is a separated presheaf.\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0008> is a sheaf, and the canonical\nmap induces a functorial isomorphism\n<MATH_0009>\nfor any <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0007>\n",
